This is a client side react application, backend server is node express with a mongoose db (mongodb)

There is documentation in regards to the backend server side logic [cursor_routing.md](mdc:server/cursor_routing.md) however you can reference [query.js](mdc:server/routes/query.js) for most of the express routes. 

The purpose of the application is to provide users the ability to read books and chat with characters
[chatService.js](mdc:server/services/chatService.js) is the main logic for chatting
[generationService.js](mdc:server/services/generationService.js) is our main service for AI generation using the Privateer API
[auth.js](mdc:server/controllers/auth.js) & [auth.js](mdc:server/controllers/auth.js) contain most of our authorization and authentication logic
When creating or updating server routes, update the [cursor_routing.md](mdc:server/cursor_routing.md) file
